OTOGAKURE TECHNIQUE REFERENCE
DISTRIBUTION: ELITE GUARD
Scroll Ref: KJ-SF-005

SUBJECT: Signature Techniques of the Sound Four / Sound Five

This scroll catalogs the personal arts of Lord Orochimaru's elite bodyguard. It is held
for training successors, not for general circulation.

Tayuya — Genjutsu of the Doki
Wields a flute to command the three ogre-like Doki. The melody binds a target's mind and
directs the summons; the true technique lies in the sound, not the creatures.

Sakon and Ukon — Parasitic Fusion
Two brothers sharing one body. Ukon can merge into an enemy at the cellular level and
destroy them from inside. The most dangerous close-range pair we field.

Jirobo — Earth Techniques / Chakra Absorption
Great physical strength paired with earth-style barriers. Can drain an opponent's chakra
through sustained contact.

Kidomaru — Spider Techniques
Produces adhesive web and hardened chakra-arrows fired with a fourth and sixth limb.
A ranged specialist and trap-layer.

Kimimaro — Shikotsumyaku (Dead Bone Pulse)
The strongest of the Five. Manipulates his own skeleton as weapon and armor. Unique to
the Kaguya bloodline; the designated preferred vessel before illness took him.
